VENDING MACHINES: A BREED OF MACHINE THAT HAS LEARNED TO LOVE THE UNIDENTIFIED.
THE GUIDE NOTES THAT THEY CONSISTENTLY PREFER THINGS NOBODY RECOGNISES. THIS
SAYS SOMETHING, AND IT IS NOT FLATTERING.

